---
const UPDATED = "2026-08-04";
---
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Mimari — K0 Anayasa · Provider Orchestrator — We Lock AI</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Lumos K0 foundation principles: modeller Lumos'a bağlanır; provider değişebilir, politika ve deneyim değişmez; insan nihai karar vericidir."
  />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://welockai.com/mimari" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/magazine-chrome.css" />
  <style>
    .mimari-brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }
    .mimari-brand img {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
    .mimari-brand__sub {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: #0f7a72;
    }
    .mimari-principles {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    }
    .mimari-principles article {
      padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 32, 41, 0.08);
    }
    .mimari-principles h3 {
      margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
      font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .mimari-principles p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #3a4f5c;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .mimari-kn {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.65rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .mimari-kn span {
      display: block;
      padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #102029;
      color: #e8eef2;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .mimari-kn small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #9aa8bc;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
    .mimari-hero-marks {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .mimari-hero-marks img {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25));
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="magazine-page">
  <nav class="magazine-nav" aria-label="Lumos Dünya">
    <div class="magazine-nav__bar">
      <a class="mimari-brand magazine-nav__brand" href="/">
        <img src="/logo001-mark.png" width="40" height="40" alt="" decoding="async" />
        <span>
          Lumos
          <span class="mimari-brand__sub">WE LOCK AI</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <ul class="magazine-nav__list">
        <li><a class="magazine-nav__link" href="/">Ana sayfa</a></li>
        <li><a class="magazine-nav__link" href="/world">Dünya</a></li>
        <li><a class="magazine-nav__link" href="/trust">Güven</a></li>
        <li><a class="magazine-nav__link magazine-nav__link--active" href="/mimari">Mimari</a></li>
        <li><a class="magazine-nav__link" href="/kararlar">Kararlar</a></li>
        <li><a class="magazine-nav__link" href="/help">Yardım</a></li>
        <li>
          <a
            class="magazine-nav__link"
            href="https://github.com/candasoz01-cmd/Lumos/tree/main/docs/ops"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >GitHub</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="magazine-page-hero" style="background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0c1820,#0f4c47);">
    <div class="magazine-page-hero__copy">
      <div class="mimari-hero-marks" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/logo001-mark.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" />
        <img src="/north-star-mark.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" />
      </div>
      <p class="magazine-kicker" style="color:#9fdad4">K0 · FOUNDATION</p>
      <h1>Provider Orchestrator</h1>
      <p>
        Lumos hiçbir modele bağlı değildir. Modeller Lumos’a bağlanır. Tek deneyim; yerel adaptasyon; ortak çekirdek.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="magazine-main">
    <section class="magazine-section">
      <h2>K0 — Anayasa ilkeleri</h2>
      <p class="magazine-note">
        K0 değişmesi en zor tasarım ilkeleridir. Diğer tüm mimari belgeler K0 ile uyumlu olmak zorundadır. İlk soru:
        <strong>«Bu K0 ile çelişiyor mu?»</strong>
      </p>
      <div class="mimari-principles">
        <article>
          <h3>P1 — Modeller Lumos’a bağlanır</h3>
          <p>Sağlayıcı bağımsız omurga. OpenAI, Qwen, GLM veya yenisi — mimari kalır.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>P2 — Provider değişebilir</h3>
          <p>Politika değişmez. Kullanıcı deneyimi değişmez.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>P3 — Tek Lumos</h3>
          <p>Yerel deneyim. Ortak çekirdek. (TR · UK · CN · GR · …)</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>P4 — İnsan nihai karar vericidir</h3>
          <p>Lumos önerir, orkestre eder ve uygular; yetki kullanıcı veya yetkilendirilmiş kurumdadır.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>P5 — Güven varsayılmaz; doğrulanır</h3>
          <p>Preflight, kanıt, audit. «Çalışır görünüyor» yetmez.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>P6 — Aynı görev + aynı politika ⇒ aynı sonuç</h3>
          <p>Deterministik, izlenebilir politika kararı.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="magazine-section">
      <h2>Kn katmanları</h2>
      <div class="mimari-kn">
        <span>K0 <small>Foundation / Constitution</small></span>
        <span>K1 <small>Strategic Architecture</small></span>
        <span>K2 <small>Governance &amp; Policy</small></span>
        <span>K3 <small>Runtime Architecture</small></span>
        <span>K4 <small>Regional Profiles</small></span>
        <span>K5 <small>Integration Catalog</small></span>
        <span>K6 <small>Canonical Decisions</small></span>
      </div>
      <p class="magazine-note" style="margin-top:1rem">
        Karar kayıtları ayrı numaralanır (<code>D1…Dn</code>). Çin AI kısa listesi: <strong>Qwen P1</strong> · <strong>GLM P2</strong>.
      </p>
      <div class="magazine-cta-row">
        <a
          class="magazine-btn magazine-btn--primary"
          href="https://github.com/candasoz01-cmd/Lumos/blob/main/docs/ops/K0-foundation-principles.md"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >K0 kaynak (GitHub)</a
        >
        <a
          class="magazine-btn"
          href="https://github.com/candasoz01-cmd/Lumos/blob/main/docs/ops/Kn-architecture-index.md"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Kn indeks</a
        >
        <a class="magazine-btn" href="/trust">Güven Merkezi</a>
        <a class="magazine-btn" href="/kararlar">Kararlar</a>
      </div>
      <p class="magazine-note">Güncelleme: {UPDATED} · We Lock AI yüzeyi · canlı runtime iddiası yok.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="magazine-footer">
    <div class="magazine-footer__inner">
      <p class="magazine-footer__meta">Lumos · We Lock AI · welockai.com/mimari</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
